[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2967655959","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107460#issuecomment-2967655959","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107460","id":2967655959,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6w4tYX","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-12T17:26:01Z","updated_at":"2025-06-12T17:27:19Z","body":"You also need to update the version in the CI config.\r\n\r\nShould we really make 4.0.10 the min? I believe this compat breakage happened in earlier versions so we should still theoretically be able to support earlier versions.\r\n\r\nI do think there's value in ensuring that everyone uses the same version by default, but at the same time people might have valid reason to use an older or newer version (e.g. for 3.x mono versions were pinned on pretty old Emscripten releases, I don't know if we'll have a similar problem with the new 4.x .NET support).\r\n\r\nI would suggest something like:\r\n- Set the minimum to the first version we can compile for with the current code\r\n- Pin our recommended version (4.0.10), and print a non-blocking warning when the Emscripten version is different","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2967655959/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2967746889","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107460#issuecomment-2967746889","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107460","id":2967746889,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6w5DlJ","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-12T17:59:28Z","updated_at":"2025-06-12T17:59:28Z","body":"> I believe this compat breakage happened in earlier versions so we should still theoretically be able to support earlier versions.\r\n\r\nThe compat breakage started in Emscripten 3.1.71 (at least per my old notes :-))\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.co