actions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2968114422","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107460#issuecomment-2968114422","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107460","id":2968114422,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6w6dT2","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-12T20:47:29Z","updated_at":"2025-06-12T20:47:29Z","body":"Yeah setting 4.0.0 as minimum sounds reasonable to me.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2968114422/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2968307562","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107460#issuecomment-2968307562","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107460","id":2968307562,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6w7Mdq","user":{"login":"michaelharmonart","id":15620900,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjIwOTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15620900?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelharmonart","html_url":"https://github.com/michaelharmonart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelharmonart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelharmonart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelharmonart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelharmonart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelharmonart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelharmonart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelharmonart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelharmonart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelharmonart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-12T22:17:17Z","updated_at":"2025-06-12T22:18:26Z","body":"would we want to set the minimum to emsdk 4.0.9?\r\nI believe that's the first version to integrate the fix for function signature mismatch from upstream LLVM\r\nat least according to the user who tested it here: https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/issues/10831#issuecomment-2918417429\r\n\r\nThat would solve issues in a few areas that are currently affected in all the official Godot builds:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104497#issuecomment-2790451350\r\n(Mainly regarding textures and audio)\r\n\r\nSetting the minimum to this version might help people avoid some headaches trying to figure out why their web builds aren't working\r\n\r\nEdit: A non-blocking warning is also probably fine as long as the official templates are built with a version higher than 4.0.9","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2968307562/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2968321719","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107460#issuecomment-2968321719","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107460","id":2968321719,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6w7P63","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-12T22:26:21Z","updated_at":"2025-06-12T22:26:21Z","body":"That's a good point. We could keep support for < 4.0.9 by checking it and disabling `lto=thin` if that's what's configured, printing a warning and upgrading it to `lto=full`, which should solve the bug.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2968321719/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,